{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1042640-madam-i-challenge-you-to-a-duel","id":1042640,"title":"\"Madam, I challenge you to a duel.\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-02T15:41:12-08:00","id":1042640,"title":"\"Madam, I challenge you to a duel.\"","content":"What's the Code Duello like in the different parts of Creation?<br /> <br /> How long has dueling been illegal in the 7th Legion?<br /> <br /> Is there anywhere in Creation wherein the default assumption when you instigate a duel is &quot;with broadswords, like civilized folk&quot;?<br /> <br /> Is there, in any of the three editions, a martial arts style that focuses on long, thrusting swords?<br /> <br /> Areas I'm mostly concerned with for this, in order of importance.<br /> <br /> 1. Universal or near-universal dueling conventions in Creation (if applicable) (other than the stuff in Scroll of the Monk, I know all that).<br /> <br /> 2. The Blessed Isle<br /> <br /> 3. Lookshy (before it was BANNED UNJUSTLY)<br /> <br /> 4. The rest of the Scavenger Lands.<br /> <br /> 5. The rest of the East.<br /> <br /> 6. The Haslanti League<br /> <br /> 7. The Bull's vassal-states<br /> <br /> 8. The West.<br /> <br /> 9. The rest of the North.<br /> <br /> 10. The South.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I roll Lore (Farming)!&quot;<br /> &quot;You're in an ancient Solar tomb.&quot;<br /> &quot;I roll Lore (Farming)!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1844-ranger_lord","name":"Ranger_Lord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1844_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"230"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T15:56:20-08:00","id":1042650,"title":"","content":"I don't know much about the topic of duels, but I like to imagine that in some parts of the south, the flame piece is the traditional dueling weapon.<br /> <br /> As for martial arts styles and their favoured weapons, I find this list very handy (2/2.5E).<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.brilliantdisaster.net/dif/ExaltedMA.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.brilliantdisaster.net/dif/ExaltedMA.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.brilliantdisaster.net/dif/ExaltedMA.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.brilliantdisaster.net/dif/ExaltedMA.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T16:27:16-08:00","id":1042663,"title":"","content":"IIRC the Delzahn have an honor-dueling tradition performed with knives. The Chiaroscuro Delzahn (men <i>and</i> women) are described as quick to anger and easily slighted, but duels are typically to first blood and no further. Though there are the occasional...accidents.<br /> <br /> But look, Creation is a big place and has hundreds of regionally-specific cultures with their own rules and codes of behavior. You can have any dueling conventions you want. Just make up the town/city-state/empire that has them. But those things will not hold beyond that place's borders because other places will have their own very different cultures and their own very different rules. The closest thing to a Creation-wide culture is the Empire, but even that cannot impose its norms of conduct much beyond its own boundaries. Just look at all the Threshold satrapies which are colonially subject to the Realm but culturally-defined by the local people and institutions. Look at the Dreaming Sea or the far North or the Scavenger Lands where even the Realm's influence ends. There are no universal rules. Embrace the awesome diversity of the setting - it's a great thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Share your wonders in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop#post823884\" target=\"_blank\">The Artifact and Evocation Workshop</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1315-ferryman","name":"Ferryman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1315_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T16:28:50-08:00","id":1042664,"title":"","content":"Also:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ranger_Lord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1042640-madam-i-challenge-you-to-a-duel#post1042640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there, in any of the three editions, a martial arts style that focuses on long, thrusting swords?</div> </div> </div> </div>You're thinking of Melee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Share your wonders in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop#post823884\" target=\"_blank\">The Artifact and Evocation Workshop</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1315-ferryman","name":"Ferryman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1315_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"960"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T16:49:22-08:00","id":1042675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ranger_Lord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1042640-madam-i-challenge-you-to-a-duel#post1042640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's the Code Duello like in the different parts of Creation?<br /> <br /> How long has dueling been illegal in the 7th Legion?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Probably since it dug in at the ruins of Deheleshen. It might have waited until the Realm started invading, but that's the absolute latest date that I can see it happening in the absence of a canonical answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T21:50:56-08:00","id":1042805,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ferryman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1042640-madam-i-challenge-you-to-a-duel?p=1042663#post1042663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">IIRC the Delzahn have an honor-dueling tradition performed with knives. The Chiaroscuro Delzahn (men <i>and</i> women) are described as quick to anger and easily slighted, but duels are typically to first blood and no further. Though there are the occasional...accidents.<br /> <br /> But look, Creation is a big place and has hundreds of regionally-specific cultures with their own rules and codes of behavior. You can have any dueling conventions you want. Just make up the town/city-state/empire that has them. But those things will not hold beyond that place's borders because other places will have their own very different cultures and their own very different rules. The closest thing to a Creation-wide culture is the Empire, but even that cannot impose its norms of conduct much beyond its own boundaries. Just look at all the Threshold satrapies which are colonially subject to the Realm but culturally-defined by the local people and institutions. Look at the Dreaming Sea or the far North or the Scavenger Lands where even the Realm's influence ends. There are no universal rules. Embrace the awesome diversity of the setting - it's a great thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is totally some nation in Creation where they use an ancient children's card game to resolve arguments.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T22:18:43-08:00","id":1042816,"title":"","content":"In my homebrewed region, a smallish continent called Lahat in the Northwest corner of the map, the Dueling and trial by Combat or ritualized Ordeals has evolved with society so that Lawyers are expected to be martial artists, and the Position of Barrister is the equivalent of master martial artist can be hired as champions for Duels or various trials by combat. Dojofirms are schools training in specific styles and they often hire retired military heroes, and even assassins to train up and coming Barristers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-03T00:24:18-08:00","id":1042854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</